@prefix : <http://example.org/orexis/world/sensing#> .
@prefix review: <http://example.org/orexis/review#> .
@prefix sensing: <http://example.org/orexis/sensing#> .
@prefix reporting: <http://example.org/orexis/reporting#> .
@prefix ag: <http://example.org/orexis#> .
@prefix market: <http://example.org/orexis/market#> .

#  This agent's PRIVATE beliefs — and there is only one block, because it composed only one
#  capability.
#
#  What is absent is the point. No market:Bidding block: no endowment, no target, no band, no
#  price. This agent holds no stake, so it has no opinion about what a reading MEANS — it
#  records the number and announces it. Compare world/society/beliefs-fern.ttl, which is the
#  same agent in a world that gives it something to want.

##  sensing:Subscribing — the interval it asks its board to keep
#
#  Both figures sit on the constitutional floor (sensing:minSleepS 10, in
#  capabilities/sensing/ontology.ttl), because a board being brought up should be seen
#  often. They are EQUAL, and honestly so: with no stake there is no trouble to watch harder
#  for, so there is one rate. A plant agent's two differ because it has a band to be near.
:fern_agent
    sensing:fastSleepS 10 ;
    sensing:slowSleepS 10 ;
    sensing:readingGraceS 45 ;     # it still decides what is too old to be current
    sensing:alarmDeltaFraction 0.25 .  # the jolt threshold, held ready: this world's channels
                                       # arm no alarm until the board is reflashed (#151), and
                                       # the pick waits for them rather than appearing mid-life

##  How often it says how it is — belief base size, reading freshness, silent write failures.
#   Omit this line and the agent reports nothing; see orexis/metrics.py.
:fern_agent reporting:metricsIntervalS 60 .

##  Self-review — how often at the very least.
#   Required because the world gave this agent room to move (review:commits, in world.ttl): an
#   agent granted none derives no review capability and needs no interval. A FLOOR and not a
#   schedule — a decision plans its own next arising from when its effect could show.
#   See knowledge/decisions/self-review-is-a-capability.md.
:fern_agent review:reviewIntervalS 300 .
